{% set review_states = {"not_reviewed": "⏳ 尚未审查", "reviewing": "🔎 审查中", "preliminary": "📝 初步结果已发布 · 深度审查中", "approved": "✅ 已通过", "changes_requested": "🚧 需要修改", "comment": "💬 已完成 · 有补充意见", "incomplete": "⏸️ 部分审查未完成"} -%}
{% set stage_states = {"pending": "⏳ 待开始", "running": "🔎 进行中", "completed": "✅ 已完成", "skipped": "➖ 无需执行", "incomplete": "⏸️ 未完成"} -%}
{% set finding_states = {"unresolved": "🚧 未解决", "partial": "🛠️ 部分解决", "resolved": "✅ 已解决", "superseded": "➖ 已被后续变更取代"} -%}
{% set priorities = {"P0": ["high", "High"], "P1": ["high", "High"], "P2": ["medium", "Medium"], "P3": ["low", "Low"]} -%}
{% set decisions = {"remove": "删除", "merge": "合并", "replace": "替换", "retain": "保留"} -%}
## Nyanpasu 审查看板

**审查状态：** {{ review_states[data.status] }}

**{% if data.status == "not_reviewed" %}待审查版本{% else %}审查版本{% endif %}：** {{ data.source.head_sha }}

**目标分支：** {% if meta.repository %}<a href="{{ meta.repository.url }}/tree/{{ data.source.base_ref }}">{{ data.source.base_ref }}</a>{% else %}{{ data.source.base_ref }}{% endif %}

{{ data.summary | md_body }}

{% if data.stages is defined -%}
<table>
<thead>
<tr><th>审查阶段</th><th>进度</th><th>范围与结果</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
{% for key, label in [("general", "常规审查"), ("deep", "深度审查")] -%}
<tr>
<td nowrap valign="top">{{ label }}</td>
<td nowrap valign="top">{{ stage_states[data.stages[key].status] }}</td>
<td valign="top">{{ data.stages[key].summary | md_body }}</td>
</tr>
{% endfor -%}
</tbody>
</table>

{% endif -%}
{% if data.ci is defined -%}
{% set ci_states = {"analyzing": "🔎 分析中", "completed": "已分析", "incomplete": "⏸️ 分析未完成"} -%}
### CI 异常

**检查版本：** {{ data.ci.source.head_sha }} · {{ ci_states[data.ci.status] }}

<table>
<thead>
<tr><th>失败检查</th><th>原因与现状</th><th>证据</th><th>建议下一步</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
{% for id, failure in data.ci.failures | dictsort_natural -%}
<tr>
<td valign="top">{{ failure.name | md_link(failure.url) }}</td>
<td valign="top">{{ failure.summary | md_body }}</td>
<td valign="top">{% if failure.evidence is defined %}{{ failure.evidence | md_body }}{% else %}待确认{% endif %}</td>
<td valign="top">{% if failure.next_step is defined %}{{ failure.next_step | md_body }}{% else %}待分析{% endif %}</td>
</tr>
{% endfor -%}
</tbody>
</table>

{% endif -%}
{% if data.findings -%}
### 审查发现

{% for label, statuses, expanded in [("待处理", ["unresolved", "partial"], true), ("已解决或已取代", ["resolved", "superseded"], false)] -%}
<details{% if expanded %} open{% endif %}>
<summary><strong>{{ label }}</strong></summary>

<table>
<thead>
{# Unbreakable heading padding keeps GitHub from shrinking the 62px badge. #}
<tr><th>编号</th><th nowrap>&emsp;严重性&emsp;</th><th>问题</th><th>状态</th><th nowrap>规则来源</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
{% for id, finding in data.findings | dictsort_natural if finding.status in statuses -%}
<tr>
<td nowrap valign="top">{{ id | md_code }}</td>
<td nowrap align="center" valign="top"><picture><source media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)" srcset="https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/{{ priorities[finding.priority][0] }}-v2-dark.svg"><source media="(prefers-color-scheme: light)" srcset="https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/{{ priorities[finding.priority][0] }}-v2-light.svg"><img src="https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/{{ priorities[finding.priority][0] }}-v2-light.png" alt="{{ priorities[finding.priority][1] }} severity" width="62" height="18" align="texttop"></picture></td>
<td valign="top">{{ finding.title | md_link(finding.url) }}{% if finding.kind is defined and finding.kind == "simplification" %}<br><sub>精简建议（非阻塞）</sub>{% endif %}</td>
<td nowrap valign="top">{{ finding_states[finding.status] }}</td>
<td valign="top">{% if finding.rule is defined %}{{ finding.rule.title | md_link(finding.rule.url) }}{% else %}—{% endif %}</td>
</tr>
{% else -%}
<tr><td colspan="5">暂无{{ label }}的记录。</td></tr>
{% endfor -%}
</tbody>
</table>

</details>

{% endfor -%}
{% elif data.status == "approved" -%}
没有未解决的审查问题。
{% elif data.status in ["not_reviewed", "reviewing", "preliminary", "incomplete"] -%}
尚无已确认的问题记录；这不代表审查通过。
{% else -%}
本次没有需要列入看板的问题。
{% endif %}

{% set production = data.simplification.production if data.simplification is defined and data.simplification.production is defined else none -%}
{% set tests = data.simplification.tests if data.simplification is defined and data.simplification.tests is defined else none -%}
{% set has_simplification = (production is not none and production.status in ["recommended", "pending", "running", "incomplete"]) or (tests is not none and tests.status in ["recommended", "pending", "running", "incomplete"]) -%}
{% set has_split = data.pr_split is defined and data.pr_split.status != "keep_together" -%}
{% set has_comparison = data.pr_comparison is defined and data.pr_comparison.status != "no_action" -%}
{% if has_simplification or has_split or has_comparison -%}
### 改进建议（非阻塞）

{% if has_simplification -%}
#### 精简

{% for audit, label in [(production, "生产代码"), (tests, "测试")] if audit is not none -%}
{% if audit.status == "recommended" -%}
<details open>
<summary><strong>💡 {{ label }} · {{ audit.entries | length }} 条建议</strong></summary>

{{ audit.summary | md_body }}

<table>
<thead>
<tr><th>范围</th><th>建议</th><th>保留的行为与验证依据</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
{% for entry in audit.entries -%}
<tr>
<td valign="top">{{ entry.scope | md_body }}</td>
<td valign="top"><strong>{{ decisions[entry.decision] }}</strong><br>{{ entry.alternative | md_body }}</td>
<td valign="top">{{ entry.contract | md_body }}<br>{{ entry.evidence | md_body }}</td>
</tr>
{% endfor -%}
</tbody>
</table>

</details>

{% elif audit.status in ["pending", "running", "incomplete"] -%}
**{{ label }} · {{ stage_states[audit.status] }}** — {{ audit.summary | md_body }}

{% endif -%}
{% endfor -%}
{% endif -%}
{% if has_split -%}
#### 拆分

{% if data.pr_split.status == "recommended" -%}
**💡 1 个拆分方案**

{{ data.pr_split.summary | md_body }}

箭头表示前置部分 → 后续部分；目标分支为 {{ data.source.base_ref | md_code }}。

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    target["目标分支"]
{% for id, part in data.pr_split.parts | dictsort_natural -%}
    {{ id }}["PR {{ id }}"]
{% if part.depends_on -%}
{% for dependency in part.depends_on -%}
    {{ dependency }} --> {{ id }}
{% endfor -%}
{% else -%}
    target --> {{ id }}
{% endif -%}
{% endfor -%}
```

<table>
<thead>
<tr><th>部分</th><th>PR 主题</th><th>内容与范围</th><th>验证</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
{% for id, part in data.pr_split.parts | dictsort_natural -%}
<tr>
<td nowrap valign="top">{{ id }}</td>
<td valign="top">{{ part.title | md_body }}</td>
<td valign="top">{{ part.scope | md_body }}</td>
<td valign="top">{{ part.validation | md_body }}</td>
</tr>
{% endfor -%}
</tbody>
</table>

<details>
<summary>如何按依赖提交（stack）</summary>

{{ data.pr_split.access | md_body }}

先按表重组混合提交，每部分携带对应测试和文档；逐层验证，并核对顶层最终树与原 PR 一致。独立部分各自向目标分支开普通 PR；只将有依赖的线性链组成 stack，分叉或多前置依赖按图分别安排提交。

{% if data.pr_split.submission in ["upstream", "unknown"] -%}
**有上游写权限：** 将各层分支放在上游仓库，在已按依赖拆好的一条分支链上注册并提交（替换目标分支与分支名）：

```bash
gh stack init --base <target> <layer-1> <layer-2>
gh stack view
gh stack submit
```

下层更新后用 `gh stack rebase` 调整上层，或用 `gh stack sync` 同步整条链。上述命令管理已拆好的分支，不会自动拆开混合提交。参见 [gh-stack 使用说明](https://github.com/github/gh-stack)。

{% endif -%}
{% if data.pr_split.submission in ["fork", "unknown"] -%}
**Fork 贡献者：** 分支保留在 fork，先将底层向上游目标分支提交；上层暂留本地，或在 fork 内以其前置分支为 base 开 draft PR。底层合入后，只将上层独有提交 rebase 到更新后的上游目标分支，再提交下一层；若底层被 squash，注意排除其旧提交。

Fork 内 PR 只用于增量审阅；上游 PR 的 base 不能指向 fork 独有分支。多个累计 PR 同时指向上游目标分支会包含重复差异。[GitHub 原生 stack 要求所有分支位于同一仓库](https://docs.github.com/en/pull-requests/how-tos/create-pull-requests/creating-stacked-pull-requests)。

{% endif -%}

</details>

{% else -%}
**{% if data.pr_split.status == "analyzing" %}🔎 分析中{% else %}⏸️ 分析未完成{% endif %}** — {{ data.pr_split.summary | md_body }}

{% endif -%}
{% endif -%}
{% if has_comparison -%}
#### 相关 PR

